  dialogueText: {fileID: 1991949359}
  dialogueLines:
  - Great... another puzzle. And this one sounds like a trap.
  - "Chests that could be decoys, a key that\u2019s hidden... nothing\u2019s ever
    simple in this place."
  - "Alright, Hazil, focus. I\u2019ve made it this far\u2014I can\u2019t get stuck
    here."
  - "I just need to take my time, observe everything, and trust my instincts. There\u2019s
    always a clue"
