  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 538711019}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1439340154}
  dialogueLines:
  - "I\u2019m really not comfortable with that teleport... It\u2019s making me feel
    nauseous, like seasickness."
  - "And that message... it\u2019s still bothering me."
  - I need to find someone else besides Alice. I need proof that people are actually
    living in this so-called abandoned mansion.
  - "I can\u2019t even contact Mr. Abraham\u2014the connection here is completely
    lost."
  - How far did I fall from the outside of the mansion...?
  wordSpeed: 0.05
